--- !u!114 &874915971
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 874915969}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Michele Robinson\r\nAnti-memetics Division\r\nYou found it, good. Hopefully
    i am the one who found me, because if it\u2019s someone else it means i failed.
    It\u2019s time i tell you the truth, this trip is going to end you, there\u2019s
    no way out, you have 2 options and both have the same outcome, death, except
    that one of them saves everyone else.\r\nYou see, 3125 infects someone\u2019s
    ideatic space in their mind and uses them to get out to the world the host lives
    in, kind of how we live in a 4th dimensional universe but only experience the
    3rd dimension. 3125 has no control over the ideatic space of the host but can
    do whatever it wants to the world the host lives in, and we can exploit that.\r\n3125
    doesn\u2019t like being known, especially if it\u2019s a lot of info, it hates
    that. We can take advantage of it and trap it in another mind, in this case,
    mine, or yours depending on who\u2019s reading it. Since you\u2019re inside the
    host\u2019s ideatic space, and the host is most probably dead, if you lure 3125
    into your mind, it occupies it and gets trapped in you, and you are trapped inside
    someone else's mind so IN THEORY, since nobody in the ideatic space in which
    you\u2019re in knows about it, it will stop existing as long as nobody back on
    earth knows it\u2019s existence. The earth, also, IN THEORY, should reset back
    to the moment before 3125 invaded us, and every human, dead or alive will forget
    everything that happened during 3125 and everything should return to normal.
    Search around a little, there should be in-depth research about 3125 and a way
    to lure it into your brain for the greater good. It\u2019s been a year since
    it came, let\u2019s finally win this war\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
