--- !u!114 &1794147113
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1794147111}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Researcher Michele Robinson\r\nSCP Foundation anti-memetics division\r\n\r\nThis
    is written by me, for me\u2026 The entire enti-memetics division is dead, every
    singly researcher except me and the world is ending, a cat \u0398 antimeme is
    wrecking havoc on earth and will soon, inevitably end us. An antimeme is an object
    or an entity with the ability to delete memories and info about it, thats the
    reason you don\u2019t remember anything and i wrote it. Hopefully, you found
    the host of the antimeme and entered is Ideatic space before the end of the world
    which, if you\u2019re reading this, you did because outside of Ideatic space
    this Info would have been erased if you had opened the hermetically sealed box
    which this note was locked in. You may be asking how do i know all that, and
    im about to tell you. In site-41 there is a Containment Chamber is perfect condition,
    but as it turns out, its no ordinary CC. It\u2019s the only place in the universe
    where SCP-3125 isn\u2019t in, we can talk, research and write everything but
    we forger everything once we get out. You see, 3125 is also a cognito-hazard,
    meaning that if you know it, and it know you know it, you\u2019re pretty much
    dead within the day. I can\u2019t risk giving more info in this note, since you,
    or rather, I am in the host\u2019s ideatic space i should look for something,
    anything. The place will be weird, if my information is correct the host which
    3125 lives in is a child, expect drawing and stuff. There is probably a house
    too in which i have uploaded more info, go get it and follow the instruction.
    Expect the house to be pretty empty since it\u2019s what the child remembers,
    he\u2019s not going to remember his fathers office or something vividly.  The
    notes are inside boxes, i made sure they stand out so you'll know                                                                                                                                      
    (open and close them with [e])"
